# k.actions/shards/verbs-ask: 19 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "ask" (ask, inquire, enquire, wonder, query, question, tell, explain ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1: the verb, its sense numbers and the gloss of 19 verbs; which act a sense means and the roles are a language model's reading, named=model)
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: 0 verbs that WordNet does not list in this meaning, and the markings; sources/hand-core/act-verbs.tsv)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/acts-core.mjs

@k.actions.verb.ask.ask k.actions.verb text=ask act=ask sense=2 sense=4 gloss="direct or put; seek an answer to" object=topic named=model core.source="wordnet 3.1"
